{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>天文台表示，本港明日（15日）天氣預測初時部分時間多雲，有一兩陣微雨。明早最低氣溫約22°C，日間大致天晴，最高氣溫約27°C。吹輕微至和緩北至東北風。展望隨後一兩日雲量較多，但下周一（16日）風勢較大。下周三（18日）北風增強，稍後氣溫顯著下降。下周後期早晚普遍清涼。（天文台）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T10:23:25.855284+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T09:34:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T16:00:51.464246+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T10:16:53.575520+00:00","content_hash":"6b2251d08e9aa5e17eb1fbf62345108417feac42bf0c3da3bad773610b8c4a4f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}